1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:07,200
Have you ever imagined exploring the universe without ever leaving Earth?

2
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:14,700
Despite incredible advances in space science, exploring the universe remains out of reach for many.

3
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:22,400
Introducing ORBIT — a new destination where education meets the extraordinary world of space exploration.

4
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:29,600
From discovering distant planets to experiencing life aboard a space station,

5
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:36,200
from walking on the Moon to exploring the mysteries of Mars.

6
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:45,200
Through immersive technology and interactive experiences, we transform scientific knowledge into unforgettable adventures.

7
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:55,200
Our mission is not just to teach people about space, but to inspire the next generation to become part of its future.

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,600
ORBIT — bringing the universe closer to everyone.
